# Build context exclusions.
#
# Without this file the host's obj/ and node_modules/ are copied into the image and overwrite the
# restore performed inside the container. The host artefacts reference absolute paths that do not
# exist in the image, so the build fails with NETSDK1064 or silently ships host-native binaries.

# --- Secrets ---
.env
*.env.local
appsettings.*.local.json

# --- .NET build output ---
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/[Tt]est[Rr]esults/
**/*.user

# --- Node build output ---
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vite/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Version control and tooling ---
.git/
.github/
.gitignore
.vs/
.idea/
.DS_Store

# --- Documentation and specifications ---
# Not needed to build a runnable image, and excluding them keeps the context small so a docs edit
# does not invalidate the Docker layer cache.
docs/
sdd_strategy/
*.md
Astrolabe*.html
